          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "地质剖面遥感解译业务问题",
          "html": "<p>一幅 1:5 万图幅的目视解译需一到两周，且同一影像不同解释员勾绘的界线可相差上百米；植被与风化层覆盖区信噪比低，人工容易漏判。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"异组样品特征分布\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.08</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.1</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.27</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.3</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.47</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.66</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.7</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.85</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.9</text><circle cx=\"183.34\" cy=\"166.75\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"259.75\" cy=\"190.25\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"227.81\" cy=\"137.61\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"324.71\" cy=\"192.22\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"218.66\" cy=\"164.38\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"240.95\" cy=\"180.79\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"216.10\" cy=\"162.04\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"224.44\" cy=\"167.26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=